  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support Civil Society in Timor Leste; From Governance to Rights</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support capacity building and advocacy civil soceity in Timor Leste. The project aims that Timorese civil society organizations&apos; voices have been successful in persuading the government to support laws and policies in the field of human rights and social inclusion related issues because of their increased capacity and strong collaborative advocacy.
The planned effects for the target group of the Project are 6 grass root organizations, trauma counsellors, survivors of gender-based violence, and policy makers.</narrative>
  </description>
